# Patterns the recoil miner skips. Same shape as gitignore but smaller:
# - trailing slash means "skip this directory and everything under it"
# - bare names are matched as glob patterns against the relative path and basename
# - lines starting with # are comments
#
# Test corpora are fictional documents authored to stress retrieval. They must
# not be ingested as facts about Recoil itself.
eval/corpora/
